Date: Fri, 6 Feb 2026 08:08:38 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] UPSTREAM:PROTOCOL:sigma_dut: Add TTLM support for 3 Link Load
 balancing

Add TTLM support for 3 Link Load balancing

Propagate the BTM query reason code into the MBO field of BTM requests so
three-link load balancing cases can trigger the expected TTLM behavior.

Handle the T2LMTeardown action by issuing negotiated_ttlm teardown to
hostapd to clean up TTLM mappings for Wi-Fi 7 AP mode.

Signed-off-by: Vikram Kandukuri <vikram@qti.qualcomm.com>
